{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Sx8ydHq6fLmM1bMgzfpzcd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 causal_style_decomp_judge 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (22 个)\\n\\n- **exp-016**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp-015**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **exp015_clmm**: DONE (success) — \\n- **register_100_cf**: QUEUED — \\n- **exp013_nli_validation**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-013**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **register_pilot**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp014_logistic_decomposition**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp012_consistency_bias**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp011_nli_sensitivity**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp010_binarized_likert**: DONE (success) — \\n- **tone_pilot**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **pairwise_32b**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_32b_ate**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_8b_ate**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-21\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- register_100_cf: Register axis (academic/conversational) produces detectable style bias in GPT-4o judge comparable to formality axis, with pairwise win rate >= 60% and p < 0.05, demonstrating axis-dependent bias generalizes beyond formality（排队等待 GPU）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **gpt4o_register** (success): GPT-4o judge shows register (academic/conversational) bias detectable via pairwise but not Likert, extending Blindspot to register axis with GPT-4o and enabling cross-model GEE decomposition comparison\\n- **gpt4o_verbosity** (success): GPT-4o judge shows verbosity bias in pairwise comparison while Likert fails to detect it, extending Blindspot confirmation to GPT-4o × verbosity cell and enabling cross-model comparison with Qwen3-32B\\n- **qwen32b_verbosity** (success): Qwen3-32B judge shows verbosity bias in pairwise comparison (verbose win rate >60%, p<0.05) while Likert scoring fails to detect it, extending Blindspot finding to verbosity axis\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 14 / 负向 4 / 失败 0 / 共 21\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwe