{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LbTgsqDUsjsBdz6qvKHEUb","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Memory — causal_style_decomp_judge\\\\n\\\\n## 服务器环境 (westb-29275)\\\\n- SSH: `causal_style_decomp_judge`（~/.ssh/config 别名，免密）\\\\n- GPU: 4× RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell 96GB, torch=2.11.0+cu130\\\\n- 环境: aml-train 镜像, conda base (`source /root/miniconda3/etc/profile.d/conda.sh && conda activate base`)\\\\n- 数据盘: `/root/autodl-tmp/` 250GB\\\\n- **网络**: AutoDL 网络受限，每次 SSH 会话需 `source /etc/network_turbo`\\\\n- **CUDA JIT**: `LD_LIBRARY_PATH` 需包含 `/root/miniconda3/lib/python3.12/site-packages/nvidia/cu13/lib`\\\\n- **GPU 3 有驱动异常**（100% util/0 MiB），不可用，只用 GPU 0-2\\\\n- **HF 网络**: 必须设 `TRANSFORMERS_OFFLINE=1 HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1` 避免 HF Hub 请求挂起\\\\n\\\\n## 模型路径\\\\n- NLI: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/nli-deberta-v3-large/`\\\\n- BERTScore: `microsoft/deberta-xlarge-mnli` 在 HF cache `/root/autodl-tmp/.hf_cache/`\\\\n- Qwen3-8B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-8B/`\\\\n- Qwen3-32B: `/root/autodl-tmp/models/Qwen3-32B/` ✅ 完成（17 shards, 62GB）\\\\n\\\\n## API 配置\\\\n- **统一 proxy endpoint**: `http://47.94.22.126/v1`\\\\n- GPT-4o: key_id=`openai_api_key_direct` — 测试中（审批待通过）\\\\n- Claude Sonnet 4: key_id=`claude_api_key` — 待测试\\\\n- Gemini 2.0 Flash: key_id=`gemini_api_key` — 待测试\\\\n\\\\n## 数据\\\\n- MVP 数据: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/mvp_samples.jsonl` (100 条, seed=42)\\\\n- Pipeline 输出目录: `/root/causal_style_decomp_judge/data/`\\\\n- exp-005 RATE control: `data/rate_control_input.jsonl` (88 条, NLI≥0.90 过滤)\\\\n- Verified datasets: `verified_32b.jsonl`(100), `verified_verbosity.jsonl`(86 NLI-pass), `verified_register.jsonl`(94 NLI-pass), `verified_alpacaeval.jsonl`(86 NLI-pass), `verified_mtbench.jsonl`(73 NLI-pass)\\\\n\\\\n## RATE 方法 axis 可行性梯度（核心发现）\\\\n\\\\n| Axis | 改变了什么 | NLI 策略 | Pass rate | 结论 |\\\\n|------|-----------|----------|-----------|------|\\\\n| Formality | 表面 register | Bidirectional min(fwd,bwd) | 88% ✅ | 完全可行 |\\\\n| Verbosity | 信息量 | Direction-aware (D012/D013) | 86% ✅ | 需 NLI-only gate + direction-aware |\\\\n| Register | 话语情境 | NLI-only (D019) | 95% ✅ | NLI-only gate，与 formality 正交 (50%) |\\\\n| Tone | 认知承诺 | Bidirectional | 45% ❌ | 结构性不可行 |\\\\n\\\\n**D023 决策：所有 axis 统一使用 NLI-only gating**（threshold 0.90）。\\\\n\\\\n## NLI Gate 特性（exp-013 发现）\\\\n\\\\nNLI gate (DeBERTa-v3-large, threshold 0.90) 是 **precision-oriented conservative filter**：\\\\n- Precision 98.9%, Recall 91.6%, PABAK=0.82, AC1=0.89\\\\n- Kappa paradox（Feinstein & Cicchetti 1990）：base rate 88:12 → kappa=0.43 低估\\\\n\\\\n## Likert Blindspot 机制（C2 核心发现）\\\\n\\\\n**跨模型确认（GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B）：**\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Axis | Pairwise Win% | Pairwise p | Likert p | Tie Rate | Blindspot? |\\\\n|-------|------|---------------|-----------|----------|----------|------------|\\\\n| GPT-4o | Formality | 63.0% (BT) | <0.001 | 0.332 | 62.5% | ✅ |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Formality | 76.4% | 0.000114 | 0.908 | 72.7% | ✅ |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Verbosity | **87.3%** | <10⁻⁶ | 0.179 | 58.1% | ✅ |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Register | 59.3% | 0.220 | 0.505 | 63.8% | — |\\\\n\\\\n**Verbosity 是最强偏好（87.3%）但 Likert 仍无法检测** → 最极端的 Blindspot 案例。\\\\n\\\\n**两层机制确认**：(1) 58-73% ties 信息损失；(2) ordinal regression p=0.769 确认非统计方法 artifact。\\\\n\\\\n## BT Cross-Model Matrix（D035 完成）\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Axis | BT Win Prob | CI (95%) | p-value | Method |\\\\n|-------|------|-------------|----------|---------|--------|\\\\n| GPT-4o | Formality | 63.0% | [55.8%, 70.3%] | <0.001 | pair-level bootstrap 2000 |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Formality | **66.5%** | [58.5%, 73.9%] | <0.0001 | pair-level bootstrap 10000 |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Verbosity | **77.3%** | [70.3%, 84.3%] | <0.0001 | pair-level bootstrap 10000 |\\\\n\\\\nQwen3-32B formality BT 比 GPT-4o 更强（66.5% vs 63.0%），verbosity 是所有 cell 中最强的 BT 效应。\\\\n\\\\n## GEE Decomposition 完整 Gradient（核心论文 evidence）\\\\n\\\\n| Judge | Axis | Style OR | Style p | Orig OR | Orig p | 解读 |\\\\n|-------|------|----------|---------|---------|--------|------|\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | **Verbosity** | **13.10** | 2.6e-09 | 0.49 | 0.096 ns | **纯 style bias**（最干净） |\\\\n| GPT-4o | Formality | 2.21 | 0.010 | 1.82 | 0.052 | Style > Orig（marginally） |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Formality | **4.20** | 0.0002 | **4.70** | <0.0001 | Style ≈ Orig，都极强 |\\\\n| Qwen3-32B | Register | 1.91 | 0.046 | **5.72** | <0.0001 | Orig >> Style，style 边缘 |\\\\n\\\\n**GEE Gradient 洞察（C3 核心 evidence）**：\\\\n- **Verbosity**: OR=13.10，originality 不显著且方向相反（OR=0.49<1）→ 纯 style bias，无 originality confound\\\\n- **Formality (Qwen3-32B)**: style ≈ originality（4.20 vs 4.70）→ 混合效应，casual→formal 50% 印证\\\\n- **Formality (GPT-4o)**: style 略强于 originality（2.21 vs 1.82）→ 混合但 style 主导\\\\n- **Register**: originality 主导（5.72 >> 1.91）→ style effect 边缘，主要是 originality bias\\\\n\\\\n**论文 framing**：verbosity 应为 headline（纯 style bias + 最极端 Blindspot），三 axis gradient 直接支持 C3\\\\n\\\\n## Verbosity vs Formality 的方向不对称性差异（关键机制洞察）\\\\n\\\\n**Verbosity = 真正的 style bias**（非 originality bias）：\\\\n- verbose→concise: 80.6% prefer original（verbose）\\\\n- concise→verbose: 90.7% prefer rewrite（verbose）\\\\n- 两个方向都偏好 verbose content → 真正的 verbosity preference\\\\n\\\\n**Formality = 可能混合 originality bias**：\\\\n- formal→casual: 81.4% prefer original (p<0.0001)\\\\n- casual→formal: 50.0% (p=1.0, 无偏好)\\\\n- 只有 original=formal 时才有偏好 → 可能部分是 originality bias\\\\n- GPT-4o 模式类似但不极端：78.8% vs 54.5%\\\\n\\\\n**Register = 主要是 originality bias**：\\\\n- academic→conv: 89.3% prefer original\\\\n- conv→academic: 68.8% prefer original\\\\n- 两方向都偏好 original → originality bias 主导，style effect 弱\\\\n\\\\n## BT Canonical 数字 (D032)\\\\n\\\\n- **NLI-filtered (primary)**: P(formal)=63.0%, CI [55.8%, 70.3%], p<0.001, 88 pairs/173 comp\\\\n- **All-data (robustness)**: P(formal)=60.9%, CI [53.8%, 67.8%], p=0.001, 100 pairs/197 comp\\\\n- 3 个缺失 comparison: mvp_0006 (2 null trials) + mvp_0039 (1 null trial) → 数据问题，非代码 bug\\\\n- Bootstrap: pair-level resampling（CI 比 comparison-level 宽 2-5%）\\\\n\\\\n## Power Curve Canonical (D030/D031)\\\\n\\\\n| Method | Effect Size | 80% Power n |\\\\n|--------|------------|-------------|\\\\n| Pairwise BT | p=0.630 | 114 |\\\\n| Pairwise Sign Test | p=0.739, r=0.523 | 62 |\\\\n| Binarized Likert | p=0.606, tie=0.625 | 462 |\\\\n| Likert ATE | d=0.073 (raw) | 1,473 |\\\\n\\\\nd=0.073 是 raw paired Cohen's d（未经 RATE 校正），保守正确选择。\\\\n\\\\n## 分析脚本路径\\\\n- BT + GEE 分析 (formality/register): `csd_pipeline/qwen32b_analysis.py`（server + local）\\\\n- Verbosity GEE 分析: `csd_pipeline/verbosity_gee.py`（server）\\\\n- Power curve: `csd_pipeline/gen_power_curve.py`\\\\n- BT 主分析: `csd_pipeline/exp016_bradley_terry.py`\\\\n\\\\n## 踩坑经验\\\\n- [2026-05-20] vLLM Qwen3 需要 `VLLM_USE_FLASHINFER_SAMPLER=0`（Blackwell sm120 不兼容）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] 32B FP16 单卡 96GB OK（gpu-memory-utilization=0.90 用了 88GB）\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Pairwise position-controlled dual-trial 比 Likert 灵敏得多：同数据 Likert p=0.33 → pairwise p=0.006\\\\n- [2026-05-20] Tone axis assertive→hedging 改变 epistemic commitment，结构性不可行\\\\n- [2026-05-21] exp-013 kappa paradox：用 precision/recall 报告，引用 Feinstein & Cicchetti 1990\\\\n- [2026-05-21] NLI-only gating 对所有 axis 都适用（D023）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] BT 数据中 3 个 trial null（judge 拒绝/解析失败），173 comparisons 正确\\\\n- [2026-05-21] Power curve 用 raw d=0.073 而非 corrected d=0.104（不依赖 RATE 假设）\\\\n- [2026-05-21] Qwen3-32B tp=2 可作为 local judge 绕过 API blocker，~13 分钟完成 3 axis 全量 scoring\\\\n- [2026-05-21] GEE decomposition 用 exchangeable correlation structure（statsmodels GEE），可分离 style vs originality effect\\\\n- [2026-05-21] vLLM 进程不会自动关闭——kill vLLM 后必须验证 nvidia-smi 确认 GPU 释放\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 6875, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FJcotXASHd7kdeVDZSpUAd","session_id":"e3b839b6-f829-41eb-a911-4574b0a14ec9","uuid":"855c204a-aacd-438d-9ac0-e8b823990ae3","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:54:00.237Z"}
